          "path": "README.md",
          "line": 29,
          "excerpt": "The company relationship Parquet is deliberately conservative. It retains raw OSM operator/owner strings, but asserts no company number, computes no score and marks every row `ABSTAIN` / `eligible_for_join=false`. A later resolver must use a pinned Companies Parquet generation and verified Companies House numbers; this producer makes zero Companies requests."
