          "commit": "c5dfdee3ba5dbe94c1e29ec8cfa9d47431da9506",
          "path": "README.md",
          "line": 64,
          "excerpt": "The BBC report [“Data centres could pay hundreds of millions in deposits for power demands”](https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c9q90q9qnn2o) is news context, not facility data. PipelineNews already carries its link behind three quarantined `DATA_CENTRES` context cards. This repository also defines a one-row link-only owner evidence record for a future pinned `SOURCE_METADATA` projection; it stores no article body,…"
        },
